{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spaceship</strong><br>A single-seater, fast and agile. Your ship is equipped with a quirky onboard computer that will back you up with solid advice\u2014or a funny story. In the quiet moments between blowing up enemies, you can take a break by picking new weapons or even swapping to an entirely different ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galaxy</strong><br>Several factions rule the galaxy, each with its own ideals and ways of enforcing them. Merchants, whose devotion to Profit knows no bounds. The Army, which seeks to impose order\u2014its order\u2014on the galaxy. And the Smokers, a gang of fanatics who want to bring chaos back to the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mission</strong><br>Your main job is to deliver a package to a far-off customer, but that doesn\u2019t mean you can\u2019t do a little good along the way (or a little evil, depending on your perspective).</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1332360?t=1759358888","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332360/cce55128c581f3155a6b03c957d88d6258c6afb9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759358888","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332360/dd520c2a2ee26197e8f198ae26229006c68ac0d6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759358888","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332360/dd520c2a2ee26197e8f198ae26229006c68ac0d6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759358888","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"S